{"parentUuid":"5de72c6d-75b3-48d0-95e7-6af2d0dddb71","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeLutaYK7yfK1cWkLp53u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let me pause #573 to file that issue and link it to PR #577."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4061,"cache_read_input_tokens":496308,"output_tokens":1811,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":499},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1811,"cache_read_input_tokens":496308,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeLutYntW26wa77CzeYm5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6794073-623e-49db-b872-6aaccf991953","timestamp":"2026-08-24T04:05:59.136Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"b6794073-623e-49db-b872-6aaccf991953","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeLutaYK7yfK1cWkLp53u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018A8woAe3mQaY3Uhp8BUmrh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\ngh auth switch --user PawanSikawat >/dev/null 2>&1\nISSUE_URL=$(gh issue create --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream \\\n  --title \"feat(sink-bigquery): auto-create the target table (and dataset) on first sync\" \\\n  --label enhancement --label tier-2 \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<'BODY'\n## Summary\nThe BigQuery sink should create the destination table (and dataset) when it does not exist — and re-create it when it exists **without a schema** — inferring the schema from the first written page, instead of requiring the table to pre-exist.\n\n## Motivation\nA first-ever sync can never assume the destination table already exists. Today the sink requires it to pre-exist with a schema, so `write_mode: overwrite` fails at `begin_overwrite` (`CREATE … LIKE` needs a schema'd target):\n- **404** `Not found: Table …` when the table is missing;\n- **400** `Table … does not have a schema.` when a placeholder table was created without columns (e.g. a bare `bq mk`).\n\nThis blocked migrating all 47 Meltano taps to a BigQuery-backed `faucet serve`: after creating the `tenant2425_*` datasets, every first `overwrite` run failed. Ties to the [Primary Goal](https://github.com/faucet-hq/faucet-stream/blob/main/CLAUDE.md) (reliability) and connector ergonomics.\n\n## Proposed design\n- New sink-config fields (flattened): `create_table: bool` (default `true`) and `location: Option<String>` (dataset region used only when the dataset must be created).\n- Readiness = \"target has a usable schema (≥1 field)\". A missing (404) **and** a schemaless table both count as not-ready and are (re)created via `CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE` from the schema inferred over the first page (`INT64`/`FLOAT64`/`BOOL`/`STRING`; nested objects/arrays → `JSON`). A table that already has a schema is used as-is and never dropped.\n- Honored across append (`insertAll`), upsert/delete (`MERGE`), exactly-once, and overwrite. Overwrite defers target + staging creation to the first page (which supplies the schema); an empty source creates nothing (clean no-op).\n- `create_table: false` restores strict behavior with a clear error.\n\n## Affected crates / files\n`crates/sink/bigquery/src/{config,idempotent,sink}.rs`, `crates/sink/bigquery/README.md`, `schemas/faucet.schema.json`.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- A first-ever `overwrite`/`append` run against a missing or schemaless table creates it from the first page's inferred schema and completes.\n- `create_table: false` fails fast with a clear error when the table is missing/schemaless.\n- A table with an existing schema is never dropped.\n- Unit + wiremock integration tests cover create / re-create / skip / disabled paths.\n\n## Out of scope\n- Reconciling a data page against a wrong pre-existing schema (that is schema-drift `evolve`, #194).\n\n## References\nRoadmap epic: #38. Implemented in the PR that references this issue.\nBODY\n)\" 2>&1 | grep -vE \"setValueForKey|valueForKey\" | grep -E \"https://github.com/faucet-hq\" | head -1)\necho \"ISSUE=$ISSUE_URL\"\necho \"$ISSUE_URL\" > /tmp/bq_issue_url.txt","description":"File bigquery auto-create issue"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4061,"cache_read_input_tokens":496308,"output_tokens":1811,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":499},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1811,"cache_read_input_tokens":496308,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeLutYntW26wa77CzeYm5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4e983a94-adef-45f5-907b-b8de8955957a","timestamp":"2026-08-24T04:06:13.519Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
