{"parentUuid":"ec452daa-02ff-4dc7-b67c-6659f06da788","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeLvXptYu2NVa86r1yyMt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DeXyZzUyDxkHYm3N2BzSYf","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream/docs/book/src/reference/config.md","old_string":"| `secret` | `false` | Registered for redaction the instant it is bound — never reaches a log, error, API response, audit record, or the template registry. |\n| `description` | — | Surfaced by `faucet template list`/`show`, `GET /v1/templates`, and the MCP `get_template` tool. |","new_string":"| `secret` | `false` | Registered for redaction the instant it is bound — never reaches a log, error, API response, audit record, or the template registry. |\n| `description` | — | Surfaced by `faucet template list`/`show`, `GET /v1/templates`, and the MCP `get_template` tool. |\n| `computed` | — | A **derived** value (see below). Mutually exclusive with `required`, `default`, and `secret`; excluded from the trigger surface. |\n\n**Computed params & `${map:…}`.** A param can be *derived* from other params\ninstead of supplied, via `computed:` — resolved after the ordinary params bind\nand excluded from the trigger surface (the console form, `--param`, and the HTTP\ntrigger body); supplying a value for one is an error. A `computed` expression may\nreference other params (`${param.NAME}`, including other computed params) and the\n`${map:NAME|case=value|*=default}` lookup — a small, non-Turing-complete switch on\nanother param's value. Cycles and an unmatched map with no `*` default are\nload-time errors.\n\n```yaml\nparams:\n  region:          { default: com }\n  accounts_domain: { computed: \"${map:region|ca=zohocloud|*=zoho}\" }\n# region=ca → accounts.zohocloud.ca ; anything else → accounts.zoho.<region>\n```\n\n`${map:NAME|…}` also works inline in a source/sink config value, not only in a\n`computed` param."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_read_input_tokens":538589,"output_tokens":738,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":538589,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeLvXkA3FjsKrFXr5Fe4A","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e67c67e-72e0-4fe9-886e-8298a0499659","timestamp":"2026-08-24T04:14:24.189Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
